{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Pub Toilet Simulator 25</i>, players race through the randomly generated layout of &quot;Spetherwoons&quot;, a traditional English pub, in a fast-paced, first-person scramble to reach the toilet before their piss-meter fills up. The pub features winding corridors, multiple floors, and dead ends, with each level growing larger and more complicated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players must also keep their beer-meter full by picking up beers scattered throughout the pub. Delicious pub food can be collected for extra points, but wasting time on food increases the risk of failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the levels progress, the layout of Spetherwoons becomes more complex, demanding quick decision-making, efficient beer management, and fast navigation. The goal is to reach the toilet as quickly as possible while maximizing your score and surviving the increasingly confusing environment.<br><br>Choose your character, grab a beer, and get ready for the piss-fueled adventure of a lifetime!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pee Your Pants in the Pub","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3605150/9ef44053017d8b98df534cff20d9a52f5a622bf8.jpg"},{"name":"Thirsty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3605150/e1acf86afaaf72ab49285b8b7f6783469ede62a9.jpg"},{"name":"Long Way Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3605150/a83f64e5ece55a0444b18b4aafa1a7a772ce2936.jpg"},{"name":"Iron Bladder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3605150/50caeaa85d9afb79277236e343705b5d4ba07afe.jpg"},{"name":"Headshot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3605150/e83b3ce1f2b5e95ae1edcaee07c8cea6ddd192c0.jpg"},{"name":"Sniper's Nightmare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3605150/882279db1a0c7